{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  Orbis Partnership — explains Rideau Zebra's support of Orbis International.
  Include on product pages and homepage after the Featured Project section.
  ============================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% assign language = localization.language.iso_code %}

<div class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-surface-white rz-gradient-surface-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
            <div>
                <p class="rz-overline text-content-secondary">{{ 'sections.orbis_partnership.overline' | t }}</p>
                <h2 class="rz-h2 mt-2">{{ 'sections.orbis_partnership.title' | t }}</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 text-content-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-prose">
                    {% if language == 'fr' %}
                        Orbis International est une organisation à but non lucratif qui construit des systèmes de soins oculaires durables dans le monde entier. Depuis plus de 40 ans, ils forment des professionnels de la santé, fournissent des équipements et redonnent la vue à des millions de personnes dans les communautés où les soins oculaires sont hors de portée.
                    {% else %}
                        Orbis International is a nonprofit that builds sustainable eye care systems worldwide. For over 40 years, they have trained healthcare professionals, provided equipment, and restored sight for millions of people in communities where eye care is out of reach.
                    {% endif %}
                </p>
                <p class="mt-3 text-content-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-prose">
                    {% if language == 'fr' %}
                        90 % des pertes de vision dans le monde sont évitables ou traitables. Chaque commande que vous passez chez Rideau Zebra nous permet de soutenir la mission d'Orbis : rendre les soins oculaires accessibles à tous.
                    {% else %}
                        90% of vision loss worldwide is preventable or treatable. Every order you place with Rideau Zebra helps us support Orbis's mission: making eye care accessible to everyone, everywhere.
                    {% endif %}
                </p>
                <a href="https://www.orbis.org/en/about-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block mt-5 rz-btn-md rz-btn-secondary">
                    {{ 'sections.orbis_partnership.learn_more' | t }}
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="relative order-first lg:order-none">
                <img src="{{ 'orbis-2.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Orbis medical team" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-auto rounded-md shadow-lg">
                <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center">
                    <img src="{{ 'partner-logo-orbis.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Orbis International" width="160" height="84" loading="lazy" class="h-10 sm:h-14 w-auto opacity-80">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {% comment %} Stat cards {% endcomment %}
        <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="text-center">
                <div class="rz-h1 text-content">2.2M+</div>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-content-secondary">
                    {% if language == 'fr' %}dépistages et examens de la vue en 2024{% else %}eye screenings and examinations in 2024{% endif %}
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <div class="rz-h1 text-content">38,000+</div>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-content-secondary">
                    {% if language == 'fr' %}formations pour professionnels de la santé{% else %}trainings for eye care professionals{% endif %}
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <div class="rz-h1 text-content">72,000+</div>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-content-secondary">
                    {% if language == 'fr' %}paires de lunettes prescrites dans le monde{% else %}pairs of glasses prescribed worldwide{% endif %}
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
